    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Seamus Carthy is delighted to present the iconic Garvey's Dew Drop Inn to the market. Representing a truly unique business and investment opportunity in the heart of Charlestown, Co. Mayo, this substantial residential licensed premises perfectly blends a thriving commercial legacy with vast residential potential. We are thrilled to showcase a property that retains such a wealth of traditional charm, warmth, and historic features, offering a turnkey business footprint alongside expansive options for owner-occupation or rental income. It is our immense pleasure to bring a landmark town-centre premises of such distinct caliber to discerning buyers looking to make their mark on the region's vibrant hospitality landscape. Immediate Enquiries Invited \n\nOutside\nEnclosed rear courtyard with storage accommodation offering further potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Substantial and characterful traditional licensed premises\nProminent town-centre location. \nTraditional bar with extensive seating and lounge areas, pool room, toilet facilities. Residential accommodation provided to the rear and on the upper floors.\nEnclosed rear courtyard with storage accommodation offering further potential. Excellent opportunity for an owner-operator, investor or purchaser seeking a mixed commercial/residential property.\nTraditional licensed bar premises together with residential accommodation overhead, enclosed rear courtyard and substantial attic/storage area \n All Main Services available and connected. \n Charlestown town centre location convenient to local shops, schools, sporting facilities, restaurants and other services. The property is also well positioned for access to surrounding towns and the wider Mayo/Sligo region."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
